                      $ run sys$system:sysgen
                      USE CURRENT
                      SET WINDOW_SYSTEM 1
                      WRITE ACTIVE
                      WRITE CURRENT
                      EXIT

                      Then reboot the system.

                   o  On OpenVMS Alpha, ensure the SYSMAN IO PREFIX LIST
