                      installed in memory. If it is not installed, then
                      install it:

                      $ INSTALL LIST/FULL SYS$SHARE:DECW$ICBM
                      $ INSTALL REPLACE SYS$SHARE:DECW$ICBM
                      $ EDIT SYS$MANAGER:SYCONFIG.COM

