          13.6  How can a batch job get its own batch entry number?

                   To have a batch procedure retrieve its own batch entry
                   number, use the following:

                   $ Entry = F$GETQUI("DISPLAY_ENTRY", -
                       "entry_number","display_entry","this_job")

