                   displayed. Here is an example of the SET HOST/MOP
                   command syntax utilized for this circuit:

                   $ SET HOST/MOP/ADDRESS=08-00-2B-2C-5A-23/CIRCUIT=FDDI-0

                   Also see Section 15.6.3.

